@startuml
title ExitPass Digital SI URL and QR Code Presentation Model

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Parker /\ncustomer phone" as Phone

rectangle "Site POS Server" #F3FFF3 {
    component "Issued Sales Invoice\ncanonical fiscal facts" as SI
    component "Digital SI URL\nService" as Url
    component "Security / privacy /\naccess policy boundary" as Policy
}

rectangle "Channel / terminal presentation capability" #F7FAFF {
    component "APM" as APM
    component "Cashier POS" as Cashier
    component "EC Device /\nContinuity Terminal" as EC
    component "Operator-assisted\nterminal" as Operator
    component "Future channels" as Future
}

SI --> Url : same issued SI
Url --> Policy : access, expiry,\nauthentication, audit
Url --> APM : SI URL / QR payload
Url --> Cashier : SI URL / QR payload
Url --> EC : SI URL / QR payload
Url --> Operator : SI URL / QR payload
Url --> Future : SI URL / QR payload

APM --> Phone : display/print QR
Cashier --> Phone : display/print QR
EC --> Phone : display/print QR
Operator --> Phone : display/print QR
Future --> Phone : present QR/link
Phone --> Url : view/save Sales Invoice

note bottom of Url
QR code presentation is a channel/terminal
presentation capability. It is not APM-only
and does not make the terminal fiscal authority.
end note

note bottom of SI
Digital SI and printed SI must represent
the same fiscal document and fiscal facts.
end note

@enduml
